=== Text #1 ===
> Ihr[ ha]bt wunderbare Ritual[e.] Es[ ist se]hr schön[, d]ass[ in] dieser[ Form an] Hans er[innert] w[ird.] Wir sehen[ ihn] v[or] uns[,] w[ie] wir ihn[ no]ch im Mai[ 2009] erle[bt ha]ben[.] Es f[ä]ll[t uns] schwer[, ihn] nicht[ me]hr w[ied]er[ zu] sehen[.]
[Un]ser g[an]zes Mitgefühl[ gilt] Dir und Deiner[ gan]zen[, groß]en[, lie]bev[ollen] Famil[ie.
]Hermine[,] my condolences to you and your family. It has been a long time since I conversed with you and Hans in person. My love, thoughts and prayers go out to you.
OUR CONDOLENCES FOR YOUR LOSS HERMINE. HANS IS AT PEACE NOW UNDER GOD’S CARE. WE PRAY FOR YOUR RECOVERY AND GOOD HEALTH.
We send our heartfelt sympathy to all of your family, especially to John and Ashley. Our prayers are with you.
